# Local anvil (default) needs NOTHING here — just run:
#   npm run chain     (terminal 1: anvil --hardfork prague)
#   npm run setup     (deploys contracts, writes this .env for you)
#   npm run dev
#
# For Sepolia instead, set these before `npm run setup`:
# CHAIN_ID=11155111
# CHAIN_RPC=https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
# RELAYER_PK=0x...        # a key funded with Sepolia ETH (pays gas)
# ATTACKER_ADDR=0x...     # optional; a fresh one is generated if omitted
#
# `npm run setup` writes the rest (TUSD_ADDR, SWEEPER_ADDR, ATTACKER_ADDR).

# ── Arkiv (The Blacklist registry) — optional ───────────────────────────────
# When set, every attack and every mint is recorded to the Arkiv Rabdi testnet
# and shown in the dashboard's Activity / Blacklist panel. Leave unset and the
# app still works; the panel just shows an "Arkiv off" empty state.
#
# ARKIV_PK=0x...            # a key funded with tGLM from https://hub.arkiv.network/faucet
# ARKIV_ACCESS_KEY=...      # free key from https://hub.arkiv.network/access-keys
# ARKIV_CHAIN=rabdi         # optional (default: rabdi)
# ARKIV_NAMESPACE=chainwall # optional schema prefix (default: chainwall)
